<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0009329> rdfs:label "pulmonary venoocclusive disease 2"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A rare form of pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH) characterized by a capillary infiltration of the pulmonary interstitium, bronchioles and pleura leading to elevated pulmonary arterial resistance and right heart failure. PCH is potentially fatal."@en ;
