<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0018227> rdfs:label "hypocomplementemic urticarial vasculitis"@en ;
    dcterms:description "Hypocomplementemic urticarial vasculitis (HUV) is an immune complex-mediated small vessel vasculitis characterized by urticaria and hypocomplementemia (low C1q with or without low C3 and C4), and usually associated with circulating anti-C1q autoantibodies. Arthritis, pulmonary disease, ocular inflammation, and glomerulonephritis are common systemic manifestations." ;
    ns1:category ns1:Disease ;
