<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0009055> rdfs:label "cutis marmorata telangiectatica congenita" ;
    dcterms:description "Cutis marmorata telangiectatica congenita (CMTC) is a congenital localized or generalized vascular anomaly characterized by a persistent cutis marmorata pattern with a marbled bluish to deep purple appearance, spider nevus-like telangiectasia, phlebectasia and, occasionally, ulceration and atrophy of the affected skin."@en ;
