<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0011827> rdfs:label "patent ductus arteriosus"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A congenital defect characterized by the failure of the ductus arteriosus to close soon after birth. As a consequence, blood from the aorta mixes with blood from the pulmonary artery. If untreated, it may lead to congestive heart failure." ;
