<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100234> rdfs:label "paroxysmal familial ventricular fibrillation"@en ;
    dcterms:description "A rare, genetic, cardiac rhythm disease characterized by ventricular fibrillation in the absence of any structural or functional heart disease, or known repolarization abnormalities. The presence of J waves is associated with a higher risk of nocturnal ventricular fibrillation events and a higher risk of recurrence."@en ;
